  {
   "id": "queue_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 50,
   "y": 805.0,
   "width": 240.0,
   "height": 280.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 333377415,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1347535309,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Queue + leases  (store.py)\n\nclaim \u2192 fresh claim_token\n   (fencing: every write\n    must present it)\nlease 60 s \u00b7 heartbeat 10 s\nexpired lease \u2192 reclaimed,\n   counts one infra try\nretry cap enforced at claim\n   \u2192 infra_error (worker_lost)\nper claim: vals.claim label\n   + try<N>/ artifact folder\nspent_usd summed over tries\nstartup reaper: stale claims",
   "originalText": "Queue + leases  (store.py)\n\nclaim \u2192 fresh claim_token\n   (fencing: every write\n    must present it)\nlease 60 s \u00b7 heartbeat 10 s\nexpired lease \u2192 reclaimed,\n   counts one infra try\nretry cap enforced at claim\n   \u2192 infra_error (worker_lost)\nper claim: vals.claim label\n   + try<N>/ artifact folder\nspent_usd summed over tries\nstartup reaper: stale claims",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "queue",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
