   "locked": false,
   "text": "Extension seams  (\u00a75.3: v1  \u2192  later)\n\nTransport\n   stdio \u00b7 TCP + token  \u2192  TLS / WebSocket\nAgentLauncher\n   Docker \u00b7 Phantom \u00b7 Installed \u00b7 Host  \u2192  Remote\nSandboxProvider\n   Docker  \u2192  Modal \u00b7 Daytona \u00b7 Firecracker\nModelGateway\n   direct secret  \u2192  logging proxy\nQueue\n   SQLite  \u2192  Postgres (SKIP LOCKED)\nResultStore / ArtifactStore\n   SQLite + disk  \u2192  Postgres + S3\nTrialRunner\n   child per slot  \u2192  remote workers",
   "originalText": "Extension seams  (\u00a75.3: v1  \u2192  later)\n\nTransport\n   stdio \u00b7 TCP + token  \u2192  TLS / WebSocket\nAgentLauncher\n   Docker \u00b7 Phantom \u00b7 Installed \u00b7 Host  \u2192  Remote\nSandboxProvider\n   Docker  \u2192  Modal \u00b7 Daytona \u00b7 Firecracker\nModelGateway\n   direct secret  \u2192  logging proxy\nQueue\n   SQLite  \u2192  Postgres (SKIP LOCKED)\nResultStore / ArtifactStore\n   SQLite + disk  \u2192  Postgres + S3\nTrialRunner\n   child per slot  \u2192  remote workers",
