   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Error taxonomy\nagent's fault  \u2192  graded, score 0\n   wrong \u00b7 step/cost limit \u00b7 timeout\n   crash \u00b7 bad protocol messages\n   deleted workspace \u00b7 bad links\n   grader hang \u00b7 faked pass\nharness fault  \u2192  infra_error\n   Docker failure (Sandbox.alive())\n   image \u00b7 adapter \u00b7 unparsable grade\n   retried, excluded from accuracy\nRule: nothing the agent can do\n   may produce infra_error\naccuracy \u00b1 SEM over attempts",
   "originalText": "Error taxonomy\nagent's fault  \u2192  graded, score 0\n   wrong \u00b7 step/cost limit \u00b7 timeout\n   crash \u00b7 bad protocol messages\n   deleted workspace \u00b7 bad links\n   grader hang \u00b7 faked pass\nharness fault  \u2192  infra_error\n   Docker failure (Sandbox.alive())\n   image \u00b7 adapter \u00b7 unparsable grade\n   retried, excluded from accuracy\nRule: nothing the agent can do\n   may produce infra_error\naccuracy \u00b1 SEM over attempts",
